  vendorName: Bruiser Krev
  offerText: You better pay the local protection fee right now. It's steep, but it
    keeps the real vicious types from ruining your miserable little life.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the extortion money with a heavy sigh. It hurts
    your wallet, but knowing the gangs will leave you alone gives you some peace
    of mind.
  rejectResultText: You bravely tell him to get lost and slam the door! You feel
    incredibly tough and proud of yourself.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Krev's gang breaks in while you are away! They smash your
    windows, trash your belongings, and paint vile threats on your walls, absolutely
    destroying your morale!
